Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vivToken}}

### * 비밀번호 확인 (회원전용)
POST {{HOST}}/Auth/CheckPassword
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vivToken}}

{
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### * 비밀번호 재설정 (비밀번호 분실시)
POST {{HOST}}/Auth/ResetPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "replyUrl": "{{resetPasswordUrl}}"
}

### * 비밀번호 변경 (회원용)
PUT {{HOST}}/Auth/ChangePassword
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vivToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### * 회원정보 수정
