### * 로그아웃
POST {{HOST}}/Auth/SignOut
Authorization: Bearer {{vivToken}}

### * 나의정보
GET {{HOST}}/Auth/UserDetail
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vivToken}}

### * tempId
